    "body": "Of course @annevk! You are always preaching about having real world use cases/usage and I agree 💯 . Difficult to use an eraser on stone. #FreeJewelry 💍 💎 \r\n\r\nWill discuss with my colleagues and go through some thorough use cases before raising issue. You all have enough to deal with already.\r\n\r\nThe fact you didn't say _\"No\"_ means `ParentElement.remove([element, ... , n])` may be an idea worth investigating and we are currently dealing with that hoop now.\r\n\r\nThanks as always for feedback, and Have a great week!\r\n\r\n/cc @brandondees @tmornini @RobertChristopher @btakita",
